  "reason": "The strongest completed result is config_019 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000, resnet50, avgpool, weighted; 0.639 accuracy / 0.620 F1), with weighted fusion outperforming concat and multiprofile avgpool outperforming transformer in the RNA-only comparison. The key unresolved question in this best branch is whether transformer aggregation can improve over avgpool when fused with image features. config_021 changes only aggregation from avgpool to transformer while keeping the otherwise best settings, directly isolating the aggregation effect in the current promising multimodal setting. Under a limited budget, this is the best next experiment because it is a minimal, high-information extension of the current best: if it improves, it identifies a better aggregation; if not, it confirms avgpool and lets later experiments focus on RNA encoder or image encoder choices."
}

